  "solution": {
    "text": "Let rod is placed along <math><mi>x</mi></math>-axis. Mass of element <math><mi>P</mi><mi>Q</mi></math> of length <math><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math> situated at <math><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>x</mi></math> is<br/><br/><br/><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://cdn-question-pool.getmarks.app/nta_abhyas/jee_main/images/ci/image8-0731c338-a3fc-4c45-a2a2-25d848e0bf85.jpg\" style=\"max-width:100%; object-fit:contain\" style=\"width: 328px; height: 82px;\" /><br/><br/>  <math><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi><mo>=</mo><mi>λ</mi><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi><mo>=</mo><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi> </mi><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></math><br/><br/>The CM of the element has coordinates (<math><mi>x</mi></math>, 0, 0).<br/><br/>Therefore, <math><mi>x</mi></math>-coordinates of CM of the rod will be<br/><br/>              <math><msub><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">C</mi><mi mathvariant=\"normal\">M</mi></mrow></msub><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>d</mi><mi>m</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>                        <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mi>x</mi><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>                        <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow><mrow><mrow><msubsup><mo stretchy=\"false\">∫</mo><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>+</mo><mi>x</mi></mrow></mfenced><mi>d</mi><mi>x</mi></mrow></mrow></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>                         <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mfrac><mrow><mn>2</mn><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow><mrow><msubsup><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mi>x</mi><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mi>x</mi></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>0</mn></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msubsup></mrow></mfrac></math><br/><br/>                         <math><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mfenced close=\"]\" open=\"[\" separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>2</mn><mo>×</mo><mn>3</mn><mo>+</mo><mfrac><mrow><msup><mrow><mfenced separators=\"|\"><mrow><mn>3</mn></mrow></mfenced></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></msup></mrow><mrow><mn>2</mn></mrow></mfrac></mrow></mfenced></mrow></mfrac><mo>=</mo><mfrac><mrow><mn>9</mn><mo>+</mo